hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek laundi ya ek aadmi masjid mein jhadu deta tha. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use na paya to Aap ne us ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Woh faut ho gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum ne mujhe us ke bare mein kyun na bataya?' Unhon ne jawab diya, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe us ki qabr dikhao.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ki qabr par aae aur us ki namaz janaza padhi."
"244","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Mansur ne kaha: Main ne Abu Mahzam ko kahte suna: Main Abu Hurairah ke sath das saal raha, main ne unhen kahte suna, main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo janaze mein hazir ho aur use teen martaba uthae to tehqeeq us ne us ka haq ada kar diya jo us par wajib tha.'"
"245","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo janaze mein hazir ho aur use teen martaba uthae to tehqeeq us ne us ka haq ada kar diya jo us par wajib tha.'"
"246","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek janaze mein tha. Jab main chalta to woh mujh se aage hote, phir main tez chalne laga. Jab main tez chalne laga to main un se aage ho gaya. Mere pahlu mein ek aadmi tha, us ne kaha: Zameen tumhare liye lapeti ja rahi hai."
"247","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni walida majida ki qabr dekhi, to Aap roe aur apne ird gird walon ko rulaya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Main ne apne Rabb se apni walida majida ki qabr ki ziyarat ki ijazat mangi, to Us ne mujhe ijazat di. Aur main ne un ke liye bakhshish mangne ki ijazat mangi, lekin Us ne mujhe ijazat na di. To ziyarat karo, kyunke woh tumhen aakhirat yaad dilati hain.'"
"248","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo janaze mein hazir ho aur dafan se pahle wapas jae to us ke liye ek qeerat hai. Aur agar woh us ke sath dafan tak raha to us ke liye do qeerat hain. Aur un donon mein se chhota Uhud pahad ki manind hai.'"
"250","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo namaz janaza padhe us ke liye ek qeerat hai. Aur jo us ke sath dafan tak raha us ke liye do qeerat hain. Aur un donon mein se chhota Uhud pahad ki manind hai.'"
"251","[AI-translation] Jallas ne kaha: Marwan bin Hakam Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas se guzra jabke woh hadees bayan kar rahe the, to us ne kaha: 'Aey Abu Hurairah! Apni baat ko taqseem karo, hadees ko hisson mein banao.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Aey Marwan! Hamen chhod do.' Rawi ne kaha, phir woh (Marwan) wapas aaya aur un se kaha: 'Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko namaz janaza mein dua farmate kaise suna?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Jo main ne kaha hai, kya tum use ginte ho?' Us ne kaha: 'Han.' Unhon ne kaha: 'Woh dua farmate the: Aey Allah! Tun ne use paida kiya, Tun ne us ki rooh qabz farmai, Tun ne use Islam ki hidayat di, Tu us ke zahir o batin ko janta hai, ham sifarishi ban kar aae hain, to use bakhsh de.'"
"252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz janaza padhte to dua farmate the: 'Aey Allah! Tun ne use paida kiya, Tun ne use Islam ki taraf hidayat di, Tun ne us ki rooh qabz farmai, Tu us ke chhupe aur khule haal ko janta hai, ham Tere paas us ke liye sifarishi ban kar aae hain, to use bakhsh de.'"
"253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak woh (maiyyat) un ke jooton ki awaz, un ki harkat sunta hai, jab woh us se munh pher kar jate hain.'"
"254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi faut hua aur us ki khoobiyan zikr ki gayin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Wajib ho gai.' Phir ek aur aadmi faut hua aur us ki buraiyan zikr ki gayin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Wajib ho gai.' Baaz logon ko is par ta'ajjub hua aur poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya wajib ho gaya? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum ek doosre par gawah ho.'"
"255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo faut ho jae aur us ke do qareebi padosi us ke bare mein gawahi den kahte hue: Aey Allah! Ham us ke bare mein siwae khair ke kuch nahin jante, to Allah Azza wa Jalla farishton se farmata hai: Main tumhen gawah banata hun ke main ne in donon aadmiyon ki gawahi ki wajah se apne bande ko bakhsh diya, aur main ne use un cheezon se muaf farmaya jinhen woh nahin jante.'"
"256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo mujh par salat bheje, Allah meri rooh mujhe wapas farmata hai taake main us ke salam ka jawab dun.'"
"257","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Aus se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Musa beemar hue to un ki biwi un par rone lagi. To unhon ne un se kaha: Kya tum ne nahin suna jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Phir jab woh faut ho gae, to Yazid ne kaha: Main us muazzaz khatoon se mila aur un se poocha: Abu Musa ne tum se kya kaha? Kya tum ne nahin suna jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Phir unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo nauha kare, apna sar munde, ya apne kapde phaade woh ham mein se nahin.'"
"258","[AI-translation] Qartha' se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Musa beemar hue to un ki biwi nauha karne lagi. To Abu Musa ne un se kaha: 'Kya tum nahin janti jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Kyun nahin?' To woh khamosh ho gayin. Phir un se poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us par la'nat farmai jo nauha kare, sar munde (gham mein), aur kapde phaade.'"
"259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke ghar mein the, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab do Musalman (miyan biwi) ke teen bachche bulughat se pahle faut ho jayen, to unhen laya jaega aur jannat ke darwaze par rok diya jaega. Un se kaha jaega: Jannat mein dakhil ho jao. Woh kahenge: Ham kaise dakhil hon jabke hamare walidain dakhil nahin hue? Phir un se kaha jaega — main nahin janta, doosri ya teesri martaba — jannat mein dakhil ho jao aur tumhare walidain bhi. To yahi Allah Ta'ala ka qaul hai: Sifarish karne walon ki sifarish unhen nafa nahin degi.'"
"260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laae jabke ham un ki beti ko ghusl de rahi thin, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Use teen martaba, ya paanch martaba, ya us se ziyada martaba ghusl do agar tum zaroorat samjho. Aur aakhri ghusl mein kafur ya thoda kafur pani mein milao. Aur jab tum farigh ho jao to mujhe khabar do.' To jab ham farigh huin to ham ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne apna tehband hamari taraf phenka aur farmaya: 'Use is se kafan do.'"
"261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hafsa bint Seereen (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ki dayan taraf se aur wuzu ke a'za se shuru karo (ghusl dete waqt).' Aur Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: 'Main ne us ke baal teen chotiyan banain.'"
"262","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti ke baal teen chotiyan banain, phir ham ne un sab ko jama kiya aur unhen us ke peeche rakha."
"263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki betiyon mein se ek beti faut ho gayin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen farmaya: 'Use pani aur beri ke patton se taaq adad mein ghusl do, teen martaba ya paanch martaba, ya ziyada agar tum zaroorat samjho. Aur aakhri ghusl mein kafur ya thoda kafur pani mein milao. Jab tum farigh ho jao to mujhe khabar do.' Jab ham farigh huin to ham ne Aap ko khabar di, aur Aap ne apna tehband hamari taraf phenka aur farmaya: 'Use is se kafan do.'"
"264","[AI-translation] Hisham ne isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki."
"265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Un cheezon mein se jin par ham se bai'at li gai thi yeh thi ke ham nauha nahin karengi (maiyyat par). Ham mein se sirf paanch auraton ne ise poora kiya: Umm Sulaim, Mu'az bin Abi Sabrah ki biwi (Raziyallahu anhu) — ya Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi — Abu Sabrah ki beti, aur ek aur aurat. Aur woh is ke liye taiyar na thi yahan tak ke Harrah ka din aaya, jab auraton ne is mein hissa liya yahan tak ke woh khadi huin; woh is ke liye taiyar nahin hoti thin."
"266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh ayat nazil hui: 'Jab momin aurten tumhare paas bai'at karne aayen ke woh Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek nahin karengi, chori nahin karengi, zina nahin karengi... aur neki mein tumhari nafarmani nahin karengi,' to unhon (Umm Atiyyah) ne kaha: Nauha (rona peetna) bhi is mein dakhil tha. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Siwae falan qabeela ki auraton ke, kyunke unhon ne jahiliyyat ke dinon mein meri madad ki, to mere liye zaroori hai ke main un ki madad karun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Siwae falan qabeela ki auraton ke.'"
"267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se bai'at li, aur us mein tha ke ham nauha nahin karengi (maiyyat par). Ham mein se sirf paanch ne ise poora kiya, aur Umm Sulaim (Raziyallahu anha) un mein se thin."
"268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen janaze ke peeche chalne se mana kiya gaya, lekin hamen sakhti se mana nahin kiya gaya."
"269","[AI-translation] Hisham ne is sanad se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat ki."
"270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ham (auraton) ko janaze ke peeche chalne se mana kiya gaya, lekin yeh takeedi mumaniat nahin thi."
"271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen yeh dua sikhate jaise unhen Quran ki surat sikhate: 'Aey Allah! Main jahannam ke azab se Teri panah mangta hun, main qabr ke azab se Teri panah mangta hun, main Maseeh Dajjal ke fitne se Teri panah mangta hun, aur main zindagi aur maut ke fitnon se Teri panah mangta hun.'"
"272","[AI-translation] Abu Ma'bad se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne namaz janaza padhai, phir takbeer kahi, phir Surah Al-Fatihah padhi aur use buland awaz se padha, phir us ke baad teen takbeeren kahin, aur kaha: Main ne buland awaz se is liye padha taake tum jano ke yeh sunnat hai."
"273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Bani Israil mein qisas tha, lekin un mein diyat na thi. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne is ummat ke liye farmaya: 'Tum par qatl mein qisas farz kiya gaya: aazad ke badle aazad...' yahan tak ke ayat pahunchi: 'Lekin jise us ke bhai ki taraf se kuch muafi di jae...' Rawi ne kaha: Us ka muaf karna yani us ka diyat qabool karna hai. To husn tareeqe se pairwi karna aur mutalba karna mashru' hai. Unhon ne kaha: Woh us se husn tareeqe se mutalba karega aur use neki ka hukm dega. Yeh izafa Sufyan se riwayat hai: 'Yeh tumhare Rabb ki taraf se riayat aur rahmat hai.' Yani: Amdan qatl ke liye diyat qabool karna."
